.TH PERF\-BENCHMARK 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 158367ea" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
perf\-benchmark \- Run the Unheaded performance benchmark suite or one named scenario.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B perf\-benchmark
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run the Unheaded performance benchmark suite or one named scenario.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-allow\-lxd
container\-start: allow creating and deleting LXD instances through Cuirass (host window only)
.TP
.B \-\-commit \fISTRING\fR
report commit (default: build info, then git rev\-parse HEAD)
.TP
.B \-\-concurrency \fIN\fR
http\-load: workers (default 64)
.TP
.B \-\-cs\-image \fISTRING\fR
container\-start: image to start (default steel\-echo\-v1)
.TP
.B \-\-cs\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
container\-start: longest wait for one instance to turn healthy (default 2m0s)
.TP
.B \-\-cuirass \fISTRING\fR
container\-start: Cuirass base URL (key in CUIRASS_API_KEY) (default http://127.0.0.1:19006)
.TP
.B \-\-curl \fISTRING\fR
http3: curl binary (default curl)
.TP
.B \-\-dashboard \fISTRING\fR
e2e\-trace: dashboard\-backend base URL (default http://localhost:20000)
.TP
.B \-\-duration \fIDURATION\fR
http\-load: how long to hold the rate (default 1m0s)
.TP
.B \-\-e2e\-timeout \fIDURATION\fR
e2e\-trace: longest wait for one event (default 5s)
.TP
.B \-\-e2e\-topic \fISTRING\fR
e2e\-trace: Wotan topic the bench packet is published on (dashboard\-backend ingests it) (default bench.perf.packet)
.TP
.B \-\-east\-p2p \fISTRING\fR
EAST P2P IPv4 address (default 192.168.13.1)
.TP
.B \-\-east\-wg \fISTRING\fR
EAST WireGuard IPv6 address (default fd00:dead:beef::1)
.TP
.B \-\-health \fISTRING\fR
Health endpoint URL (default http://localhost:19000/health)
.TP
.B \-\-http3\-insecure
http3: skip TLS verification (self\-signed gateway)
.TP
.B \-\-http3\-url \fISTRING\fR
http3: URL fetched over HTTP/3 (default https://localhost:21443/health)
.TP
.B \-\-iterations \fIN\fR
Number of iterations per test (default 50)
.TP
.B \-\-output \fISTRING\fR
JSON output file (default benchmark\-results.json)
.TP
.B \-\-poll \fIDURATION\fR
e2e\-trace/container\-start: re\-read interval while waiting (default 5ms)
.TP
.B \-\-rate \fIN\fR
http\-load: requests per second (default 1000)
.TP
.B \-\-scenario \fISTRING\fR
Comma\-separated scenarios: e2e\-trace, container\-start, http\-load, http3, all (empty: the original suite)
.TP
.B \-\-wotan \fISTRING\fR
Wotan HTTP endpoint (default http://localhost:18000)
.TP
.B \-\-wotan\-name \fISTRING\fR
e2e\-trace: Wotan display name (must be in topics.auto_approve) (default perf\-benchmark)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
perf\-benchmark
perf\-benchmark \-scenario e2e \-output results.json
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
